silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_12_worked_counterexamples_avogadro_sections_02_avogadro_walkthrough_concrete_anchor_18_TSNtaxonomicserialnumber#tsn_taxonomic_serial_number silm:hasLongDescription "The TSN_taxonomic_serial_number is the integer 183798 from ITIS catalog; a source leg, not an identifier of Mittens. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'TSN_taxonomic_serial_number', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
